      "text": "## 6. No city employee shall be required to reveal any personal information for the purposes of these censuses concerning his racial or ethnic identification, sex or handicap against his wishes, Refusal to divulge such information shall not result in any adverse consequences concerning continued employment, or promotional or any other job-related opportunities, nor shall it result in any penalty or disciplinary action for the employee involved.",
